DESCRIPTION:The classic open source dichotomy is well known: everyone uses 
 it\, but few give back for the convenience we've all grown so used to. Wha
 t sustains a community? And how can we help ensure that the frameworks and
  libraries we rely on daily remain viable and healthy in the long run? In 
 this talk\, I intend to show how easy it is to get started with your open 
 source contributions\, regardless of your seniority.
DTSTAMP:20261116T111138Z
